# game.saves = files: a ghost exported from the F1 Saves page (Export (.r49ghost), into the folder's export/), the
# first one listed, from the main menu (docs/port/SAVES.md 7). For a folder whose only save is one ghost.
# until: 0x10:200
# seconds: 60
# realtime
# args: --saves files (in a data folder of its own)
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt; the main menu (0x10) from about 8 s
10 MENU        # F1 over the main menu
10.6 DOWN 0.1  # Video, Audio, Keyboard, Controllers, Game, Saves
10.9 DOWN 0.1
11.2 DOWN 0.1
11.5 DOWN 0.1
11.8 DOWN 0.1
12.2 A 0.1     # the Saves page: Player, Kept as, Folder, Import ghosts, Export to the .mpk, then the saves
12.6 DOWN 0.1
12.9 DOWN 0.1
13.2 DOWN 0.1
13.5 DOWN 0.1
13.8 DOWN 0.1  # the first save: the ghost
14.5 A 0.1     # its page: Kind, Player, Track, Time, Car, Pages, On the pak, File, Pin/Unpin, Export
14.9 DOWN 0.1
15.2 DOWN 0.1
15.5 DOWN 0.1
15.8 DOWN 0.1
16.1 DOWN 0.1
16.4 DOWN 0.1
16.7 DOWN 0.1
17.0 DOWN 0.1
17.3 DOWN 0.1
17.7 A 0.1     # exported
18.4 START       # closed
